[Am]chaad tara [Dm]shurjo nao tumi

[G]noy pahari [Am]jharna

[Am]jodi boli phool [Dm]tobuo hobay bhool

[G]tomar tulona [Am]hoyna

[Am]tumi na alay, [E]ai prithibi [F]amar

[E]harabey aapon [Am]thikana

[Am]jodi duray raow, [E]shapnagulo [F]amar

[E]bhengey jabey [Am]janona

